 EV charging stations and recycling systems<br> 24/7 security and concierge services<br> <br> Prime Location:<br> Downtown Dubai – 20 mins<br> Dubai Marina – 15 mins<br> Mall of the Emirates – 10 mins<br> Dubai International Airport – 25 mins<br> Surrounded by top schools, clinics, and retail outlets<br> <br>Considered one of Dubai's most prestigious communities, Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) is a refreshing take on modern city living. Surrounded by greeneries and astounding real estate development, JVC is an ideal community for families who want to avoid the hustle-bustle of the city but at the same time wants to enjoy an uber lifestyle living. With a consistent ROI growth, JVC is the perfect place for investors wanting to invest and grow their portfolio.","longitude":55.2057663,"negotiator_id":"6667","negotiator_mapping":"ziad@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":1020000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"sales","slug":"1-bedroom-apartment-for-sale-in-maimoon-gardens-tower-a-maimoon-gardens-by-fakhruddin-properties-jumeirah-village-circle-dubai","status":"For Sale","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/f39/iyxyqofgos3i3wq3lc1y0i5ku8oal5l4/img309.jpg","title":"1 bedroom apartment for sale","extra":{"views":"","cheques":null,"project":null,"bitrix_id":"1483597","furnished":"Unfurnished","permit_number":"71429049455","rental_period":null,"current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Unfurnished","completion_status":"off-plan","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":[{"endDate":"2026-09-25T00:00:00","project":null,"property":{"facilities":null,"propertyId":429049455,"roomTypeAr":"غرفة","roomTypeEn":"1 B/R","roomsCount":"1","zoneNameAr":"البرشاء جنوب الرابعة","zoneNameEn":"Al Barsha South Fourth","floorNumber":"10","salesTypeId":2,"isRegistered":false,"propertySize":55.2,"parkingNumber":"1","propertyValue":1020000,"buildingNameAr":"ميمون غاردنز برج الف","b